    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d63-a4">

                <pb facs="0623" n="611" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv06/pg611"/>


                <head>Translation</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No 76</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">German Peace
                            Delegation</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Versailles</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-06-22">June 22, 1919</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In continuation of my Note No. 70 of
                    to-day’s date, I have the honour to inform Your Excellency on behalf of the
                    German Government that the National Assembly at to-day’s plenary meeting passed
                    a vote of confidence in the new Imperial Ministry by 236 votes to 89, with 68
                    abstentions.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Von Haniel</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
